{
  "slug": "promptarc",
  "name": "Promptarc",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Session intelligence for AI coding agents. Get AI briefings of past work before you start coding, generate PR descriptions from the terminal, share sessions to the cloud with automatic secret redaction, and search across your entire session history. Supports Claude Code, OpenAI Codex, and Cursor sessions in one unified view.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `context` (Get an AI briefing of past sessions for the current project), `pr` (Generate a structured PR description (What/Why/How/Notes) from the current session), `search` (Search across all past sessions in the cloud archive), `share` (Share the current session to the cloud as a private replay)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install promptarc@claude-community` from `promptarc/promptarc-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "hook": 1
  },
